# # /claire-bible/
#
# https://w3id.org/claire-bible/ and everything under it redirects to
# https://claire.bible/
#
# Claire Bible is a knowledge base server that shares knowledge between
# servers with ActivityPub. This space holds the IRIs of its JSON-LD context
# (https://w3id.org/claire-bible/ns/v1) and of its vocabulary terms
# (https://w3id.org/claire-bible/ns#...).
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# FoW
# GitHub username: fofwisdom

RewriteEngine on
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://claire.bible/$1 [R=302,L]
